        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059610/extras/e861aeb2445df2535d233f4cdac31490.avif?t=1764200600\" width=616 height=148 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to the world of errors!</strong><br>A light, cute, and relaxing logic puzzle that begins with the simplest formulas.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059610/extras/9c31e2447236b104ca9603ec205d6c40.avif?t=1764200600\" width=616 height=249 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Complete each formula to reach the target error value and clear the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059610/extras/699e3a0e1d06bc9482b5d28e3264ae7d.avif?t=1764200600\" width=616 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game offers <strong><i>15 levels and 128 handcrafted stages</i></strong> designed to challenge your logic and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059610/extras/e73828ad7bbffd11718eaf6898a4df97.poster.avif?t=1764200600\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059610/extras/e73828ad7bbffd11718eaf6898a4df97.webm?t=1764200600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059610/extras/e73828ad7bbffd11718eaf6898a4df97.mp4?t=1764200600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Errors breed more errors</i></strong>, and tiny deviations open new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059610/extras/84344802a0e203975294286442eb9203.avif?t=1764200600\" width=616 height=271 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From these errors, beings known as <strong><i>Eri</i></strong><i> and <strong>Kori</strong></i> are born — and they never forget the rituals of their creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059610/extras/464ab9eeb4f06463ada57799542bcdbc.poster.avif?t=1764200600\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059610/extras/464ab9eeb4f06463ada57799542bcdbc.webm?t=1764200600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059610/extras/464ab9eeb4f06463ada57799542bcdbc.mp4?t=1764200600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Recruit supporters</i></strong> to accelerate your progress toward the target error.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059610/extras/7398a15dbbe2dc1afe8ca31bc4dc6afe.poster.avif?t=1764200600\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059610/extras/7398a15dbbe2dc1afe8ca31bc4dc6afe.webm?t=1764200600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059610/extras/7398a15dbbe2dc1afe8ca31bc4dc6afe.mp4?t=1764200600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But beware — <strong><i>some number blocks come with their own constraints</i></strong>, adding unique conditions to your play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059610/extras/65cdf281d37b76704b996de99d0dfdc1.webp?t=1764200600\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059610/extras/65cdf281d37b76704b996de99d0dfdc1.poster.avif?t=1764200600\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Start with small calculations, and watch as they grow into a complex flow of logic and cascading errors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059610/extras/6bd7bce1b2c23c2997ad4fec2f121108.poster.avif?t=1764200600\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059610/extras/6bd7bce1b2c23c2997ad4fec2f121108.webm?t=1764200600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059610/extras/6bd7bce1b2c23c2997ad4fec2f121108.mp4?t=1764200600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
